{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01J4p4Rbz7mNGHEdSXKR53JU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted results for each planned experiment in the experiment_plan, based on the \"median\" tier definition they've provided. I need to output a single YAML block with specific predicted metrics, rationales, and analysis for each planned experiment.\n\nLet me identify all planned experiments:\n\n1. exp-ctrl-contam-pilot (planned)\n2. exp-ctrl-contam (planned)\n3. exp-leaderboard-audit (planned)\n4. exp-4pl-ablation (planned)\n\n\n5. exp-baseline-comparison (planned)\n6. exp-multiscale-lzm (planned)\n7. exp-post-rl (planned)\n8. exp-extra-benchmarks (planned)\n9. exp-domain-analysis (planned)\n\nNow I'm working through the median tier characteristics to predict outcomes for each experiment. The key constraints are that Δlz* signals are detectable but limited by benchmark size and contamination levels, with only large benchmarks like MMLU showing reliable detection at higher contamination thresholds, while smaller benchmarks and low contamination scenarios produce weaker signals that get partially obscured by SFT generalization effects.\n\nLooking at the expected metric ranges across these experiments, I'm seeing baseline comparisons show substantial AUROC gaps of 15-25 percentage points, though post-RL detection essentially vanishes. The detection thresholds cluster around 15-30% contamination for MMLU, with cross-benchmark detectability varying between 35-70% depending on benchmark size, and I'm tracking these patterns across thousands of leaderboard models to validate the tier boundaries.\n\nFor the pilot experiment with Qwen3.5-9B, I expect moderate effect sizes around Cohen's d of 0.8-1.0 at the 15% contamination level, with clear significance at 50%, though SFT generalization may partially mask the signal. The full controlled experiment across four models and six contamination levels should show consistent MMLU detection at 15% and above with AUROC values in the 0.7-0.9 range.\n\nThe leaderboard audit will likely reveal a detection bias toward universal models due to model misfit, requiring Δlz*-based reranking rather than simple thresholds. The 4PL ablation suggests the d parameter has modest but not critical impact on detection sensitivity compared to the 3PL model.\n\nIRT-FIT trades off 0.15-0.25 AUROC against the baselines but gains unique scalability to large leaderboard datasets. Cross-benchmark aggregation shows weak signal in the median tier, and post-RL experiments reveal minimal signal retention—GRPO essentially erases the SFT contamination signature. BBH and MATH occupy the gap zone between small and large benchmarks, so their detection power should fall somewhere in between.\n\nGSM8K and MMLU align with the power predictions. Now I'm looking at domain-level patterns within MMLU to see how contamination signatures vary across subjects, which should add some case study depth to the median-tier analysis. Then I'll assemble the full YAML output.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14880,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14880},"output_tokens":24,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0b23f9c3-8d77-4ff5-9fa5-c8baa7a4cbd2","uuid":"d339f702-8d27-41c1-bf27-adbdb0a01447"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01J4p4Rbz7mNGHEdSXKR53JU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 1 收窄 scope：从 \"practical detection framework\" 调整为 \"detection framework effective\n  for large-scale benchmarks (n≥10K items) at moderate-to-high contamination\"。Minimal-information\n  的代价被量化而非回避——power theory（R²=0.96）精确预测 n_items 阈值，这本身是贡献。Claim 2 的 power function\n  分析升级为论文 core contribution——理论刻画 detection boundary 比宣称高 power 更有价值。Claim 3 的 leaderboard\n  audit 定位为 large-scale anomaly profiling 而非 definitive detection，呈现 Δlz*-ranked 模型列表和\n  temporal trends 作为 converging evidence。补充 exp-domain-analysis 增加 case study 深度。需要增加\n  2-3 段 limitation discussion，明确 scope 边界。论文重心从 \"detection tool\" 偏移为 \"detection frontier\n  characterization + scalable anomaly profiling\"。仍可冲 EMNLP main，但 contribution statement\n  更侧重方法论而非工具。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Controlled Contamination Pilot\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\"\n    description: \"Qwen3.5-9B × 3 levels (0%/15%/50%) × MMLU only. 测量 Δlz*(clean→contaminated) 是否显著。\"\n    expected_results:\n      # --- baseline (0% contamination) ---\n      baseline_lz_star_mean: -18.5\n      baseline_lz_star_std: 2.1\n      baseline_accuracy: 0.62\n      baseline_theta: 1.35\n      # --- 15% contamination ---\n      contam_15pct_lz_star_mean: -20.8\n      contam_15pct_delta_lz_star: -2.3\n      contam_15pct_delta_lz_cohen_d: 0.85\n      contam_15pct_accuracy: 0.68\n      contam_15pct_theta: 1.52\n      contam_15pct_p_value_paired_t: 0.018\n      contam_15pct_significant_alpha005: true\n      # --- 50% contamination ---\n      contam_50pct_lz_star_mean: -25.4\n      contam_50pct_delta_lz_star: -6.9\n      contam_50pct_delta_lz_cohen_d: 2.8\n      contam_50pct_accuracy: 0.79\n      contam_50pct_theta: 2.10\n      contam_50pct_p_value_paired_t: 0.0001\n      contam_50pct_significant_alpha005: true\n      # --- go/no-go ---\n      go_signal: true\n      n_seeds: 3\n      seed_variance_15pct_delta_lz: 0.9\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，SFT 泛化会部分淹没信号但不会完全消除。MMLU 有 14K items，是 n_items 最大的 benchmark，\n      power theory 预测其在 15% 时已超过 80% power（min_items_15pct_80power=7958）。\n      但 SFT 不只记忆 exact items——它从污染数据中学到的 domain knowledge 会泛化到 clean items，\n      使得能力 θ 提升幅度大于纯记忆预期，同时让 response pattern 比 simulation 中更 \"合理\"（因为泛化\n      改善的 items 仍符合 ability-based 预测）。因此 Δlz* 方向正确但 effect size 低于 simulation 预测。\n      15% 时 Cohen's d ≈ 0.85（在 [0.6, 1.5] 范围偏低端），因为约 40-50% 的 accuracy gain 来自泛化而非\n      直接记忆，泛化部分不产生 aberrant pattern。50% 时信号大幅增强（d≈2.8），因为被记忆的 items 占比够大，\n      即使有泛化效应也无法掩盖 aberrant response pattern。baseline lz* 已经很极端（≈-18.5）因为 universal\n      model misfit，但 Δlz* 作为 within-model 差分仍然 interpretable（null 已验证 well-calibrated）。\n      seed 间方差中等（std≈0.9），反映 QLoRA 训练的随机性。总体结论：go signal positive，但需要完整实验\n      验证 GSM8K/HellaSwag 上信号是否也成立。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Pilot Results — Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU\"\n        columns: [\"Contamination %\", \"Accuracy\", \"θ\", \"lz*\", \"Δlz*\", \"Cohen's d\", \"p (paired-t)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0% (baseline)\", \"0.62 ± 0.01\", \"1.35 ± 0.08\", \"-18.5 ± 2.1\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"15%\", \"0.68 ± 0.02\", \"1.52 ± 0.11\", \"-20.8 ± 2.4\", \"-2.3 ± 0.9\", \"0.85\", \"0.018\"]\n          - [\"50%\", \"0.79 ± 0.01\", \"2.10 ± 0.09\", \"-25.4 ± 2.6\", \"-6.9 ± 1.2\", \"2.80\", \"<0.001\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: Δlz* vs contamination level (0%, 15%, 50%) with 3-seed error bars. 单调递增但非线性——15%→50% 的斜率远大于 0%→15%。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Pilot 确认 go signal：MMLU 上 Δlz* 在 15% 时统计显著（p=0.018），50% 时高度显著。\n      但 15% 的 effect size（d=0.85）低于 simulation 预测（simulation power 0.98 意味着 d>>2），\n      gap 来自 SFT 泛化效应。这是 median 档的核心特征——信号可检测但受限。\n      关键 implication：(1) 需要 ≥15% contamination 才有可靠信号，与 min_detectable_contam_mmlu_pct\n      范围 [15, 30] 一致；(2) 完整实验中 GSM8K（n=1319）和 HellaSwag（n=10042）可能更弱，\n      需要更高 contamination level 才能 detect。\n\n  - name: \"Full Controlled Contamination\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam\"\n    description: \"4 模型 × 6 levels (0/5/10/15/25/50%) × 3 benchmarks (MMLU/GSM8K/HellaSwag). 建立 ground-truth contamination → Δlz* 映射。\"\n    expected_results:\n      # --- MMLU (n=14042) ---\n      mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_5pct: 0.25\n      mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_10pct: 0.52\n      mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_15pct: 0.92\n      mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_25pct: 1.85\n      mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_50pct: 3.40\n      mmlu_auroc_5pct: 0.58\n      mmlu_auroc_10pct: 0.65\n      mmlu_auroc_15pct: 0.78\n      mmlu_auroc_25pct: 0.91\n      mmlu_auroc_50pct: 0.95\n      mmlu_detectable_at_alpha005: \"≥15% (3/4 models), ≥10% (1/4 models)\"\n      # --- HellaSwag (n=10042) ---\n      hellaswag_delta_lz_cohen_d_15pct: 0.45\n      hellaswag_delta_lz_cohen_d_25pct: 0.88\n      hellaswag_delta_lz_cohen_d_50pct: 1.95\n      hellaswag_auroc_15pct: 0.62\n      hellaswag_auroc_25pct: 0.76\n      hellaswag_auroc_50pct: 0.88\n      hellaswag_detectable_at_alpha005: \"≥25% (3/4 models), ≥50% (1/4 models)\"\n      # --- GSM8K (n=1319) ---\n      gsm8k_delta_lz_cohen_d_15pct: 0.22\n      gsm8k_delta_lz_cohen_d_25pct: 0.41\n      gsm8k_delta_lz_cohen_d_50pct: 0.88\n      gsm8k_auroc_15pct: 0.55\n      gsm8k_auroc_25pct: 0.62\n      gsm8k_auroc_50pct: 0.74\n      gsm8k_detectable_at_alpha005: \"≥50% (2/4 models only)\"\n      # --- cross-model consistency ---\n      cross_model_rank_correlation_delta_lz: 0.72\n      cross_benchmark_detectable_frac_15pct: 0.33\n      cross_benchmark_detectable_frac_25pct: 0.50\n      cross_benchmark_detectable_frac_50pct: 0.75\n      # --- model-level variability ---\n      model_with_strongest_signal: \"Mistral-7B-v0.3\"\n      model_with_weakest_signal: \"Gemma-4-31B\"\n      inter_model_cohen_d_range_mmlu_15pct: [0.62, 1.35]\n      # --- SFT generalization analysis ---\n      accuracy_gain_from_generalization_frac_15pct: 0.45\n      accuracy_gain_from_generalization_frac_50pct: 0.28\n      n_total_runs: 72\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档的核心预测：检测力严格受 n_items 约束。MMLU（14K items）在 15% 时 AUROC≈0.78，\n      处于 [0.7, 0.9] 范围中间偏上。HellaSwag（10K items）刚好在 min_items_15pct_80power=7958 \n      附近，但 SFT 泛化效应使得实际 power 低于 simulation 预测，15% 时 AUROC 仅 0.62——\n      因为 HellaSwag 的 commonsense reasoning 特别容易从少量 training examples 泛化，\n      泛化学到的能力提升不产生 aberrant pattern。GSM8K（1319 items）n_items 远低于理论阈值，\n      即使 50% contamination 也只有 AUROC 0.74，符合 power theory 的 √n 衰减预测。\n      \n      模型间差异反映不同架构的 SFT 泛化能力：Mistral-7B 较小且 base model 能力较低，\n      SFT 泛化有限，更多 accuracy gain 来自直接记忆→更强的 aberrant pattern→更高 Δlz*。\n      Gemma-4-31B 参数量大，泛化能力强，信号最弱。这个 inter-model 差异本身是有趣发现——\n      说明 detection power 不仅取决于 n_items 和 contamination level，还取决于模型的\n      泛化能力，为 limitation discussion 提供素材。\n      \n      cross_benchmark_detectable_frac 在 15% 时仅 0.33（即 3 个 benchmark 中平均只有 1 个可检测），\n      在 50% 时升至 0.75，与范围 [0.35, 0.7] 在中间档吻合。这支持 scope 收窄：实际可用的\n      detection 仅限于大 benchmark + 中高污染。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: AUROC by Benchmark × Contamination Level (4-model average ± std)\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark (n_items)\", \"5%\", \"10%\", \"15%\", \"25%\", \"50%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU (14042)\", \"0.58±0.04\", \"0.65±0.05\", \"0.78±0.06\", \"0.91±0.03\", \"0.95±0.02\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag (10042)\", \"0.53±0.03\", \"0.57±0.04\", \"0.62±0.07\", \"0.76±0.05\", \"0.88±0.04\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K (1319)\", \"0.51±0.02\", \"0.53±0.03\", \"0.55±0.04\", \"0.62±0.06\", \"0.74±0.05\"]\n      - title: \"Table: Cohen's d of Δlz* by Benchmark × Contamination Level (4-model average)\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"5%\", \"10%\", \"15%\", \"25%\", \"50%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"0.25\", \"0.52\", \"0.92\", \"1.85\", \"3.40\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"0.12\", \"0.28\", \"0.45\", \"0.88\", \"1.95\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"0.08\", \"0.15\", \"0.22\", \"0.41\", \"0.88\"]\n      - title: \"Table: Per-Model Cohen's d at 15% Contamination (MMLU)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Δlz*\", \"Cohen's d\", \"p-value\", \"Accuracy Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3.5-9B\", \"-2.3\", \"0.85\", \"0.018\", \"+0.06\"]\n          - [\"Mistral-7B-v0.3\", \"-3.5\", \"1.35\", \"0.003\", \"+0.09\"]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"-2.8\", \"1.02\", \"0.009\", \"+0.07\"]\n          - [\"Gemma-4-31B\", \"-1.4\", \"0.62\", \"0.042\", \"+0.04\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: Δlz* Cohen's d heatmap (4 models × 6 levels × 3 benchmarks). 颜色从白到深红。MMLU 列最深，GSM8K 列最浅。清晰展示 n_items 对 detection power 的约束。\"\n      - \"Figure: AUROC curves per benchmark，x轴 contamination %，y轴 AUROC。MMLU 曲线最陡且最早超过 0.8 阈值（~15%），HellaSwag 中等（~25-30%），GSM8K 平坦（50% 时仍未达 0.8）。虚线标注 chance level 和 0.8 practical threshold。\"\n      - \"Figure: Accuracy gain decomposition bar chart（15% level）。每个 bar 分为 'memorization' 和 'generalization' 两部分。Mistral 的 memorization 占比最高（~65%），Gemma 最低（~45%）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      完整实验确认 median 档预测：MMLU 是唯一在 15% contamination 时可靠检测的 benchmark（AUROC 0.78），\n      HellaSwag 在 25% 时才达到实用 power（0.76），GSM8K 即使 50% 也只有 0.74。\n      这与 power theory 的 √n 预测高度一致（R²=0.96）。关键发现：SFT 泛化效应解释了\n      simulation-to-controlled 的 power gap——simulation 假设污染 items 全部产生 aberrant pattern，\n      但 SFT 实际只有 55-72% 的 accuracy gain 来自直接记忆。模型间差异（Gemma d=0.62 vs Mistral d=1.35）\n      为 limitation 提供定量证据。论文中应呈现为：detection power = f(n_items, contam_level, model_generalization_capacity)，\n      其中前两个因素可预测，第三个引入不确定性。\n\n  - name: \"Leaderboard Audit\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-leaderboard-audit\"\n    description: \"Open LLM Leaderboard v1 大规模扫描：对所有可用模型计算 person-fit，绘制 per-benchmark 污染率随时间趋势。\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_models_attempted: 8500\n      n_models_successfully_analyzed: 6200\n      n_models_excluded_missing_data: 2300\n      benchmarks_analyzed: [\"MMLU\", \"HellaSwag\", \"ARC-Challenge\", \"GSM8K\"]\n      # --- absolute lz* flagging (will be nearly universal) ---\n      flagged_rate_absolute_threshold: 0.92\n      flagged_rate_mmlu: 0.94\n      flagged_rate_hellaswag: 0.91\n      flagged_rate_arc_c: 0.89\n      flagged_rate_gsm8k: 0.93\n      # --- Δlz*-based reranking ---\n      delta_lz_star_computed: true\n      delta_lz_reference: \"per-family median lz* as baseline\"\n      n_models_top_anomaly_mmlu: 185\n      n_models_top_anomaly_cross_benchmark: 42\n      top_anomaly_model_examples: [\"Gemini-1.5-Pro\", \"suspected fine-tune variants\"]\n      # --- temporal trends ---\n      temporal_trend_mmlu_flagged_rate_2023h1: 0.88\n      temporal_trend_mmlu_flagged_rate_2023h2: 0.93\n      temporal_trend_mmlu_flagged_rate_2024h1: 0.96\n      contamination_increase_trend_significant: true\n      contamination_trend_p_value: 0.008\n      # --- cross-benchmark anomaly profiles ---\n      n_models_flagged_3plus_benchmarks: 380\n      n_models_flagged_all_4_benchmarks: 95\n      cross_benchmark_anomaly_spearman_rho: 0.18\n      cross_benchmark_anomaly_spearman_p: 0.12\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 leaderboard audit 可执行但 flagging pattern 偏向 universal。这与已有 Phase B \n      数据一致——57/60 cells flagged（95%）。当扩展到 6000+ 模型时，absolute lz* 阈值仍然会 flag \n      绝大多数模型（~92%），因为 universal model misfit 是 LLM response pattern 的固有特征，\n      不是 contamination 特异性的。\n      \n      因此需要 Δlz*-based reranking 而非 absolute threshold。以 per-family median lz* 为 baseline，\n      计算每个模型的 deviation。这能识别 ~185 个 MMLU top anomaly 模型（偏离 family median ≥2 SD），\n      其中约 42 个在 3+ benchmarks 上同时 anomalous。但 cross-benchmark rank correlation 仍然弱\n      （Spearman ρ≈0.18, p=0.12），与 Phase B 发现一致——group-level 相关弱，anomaly 更多是\n      individual-level 现象。\n      \n      时间趋势分析能检测到 flagging rate 随时间增加（2023H1: 88% → 2024H1: 96%），统计显著，\n      但解释模糊——可能是 contamination 增加，也可能是模型越来越强导致 4PL misfit 加剧。\n      这正是 median 档的特征：leaderboard audit 产出 converging evidence 而非 definitive detection。\n      论文定位为 \"large-scale anomaly profiling\" 是正确的。\n      \n      实际可分析模型数（6200）低于原始可用数（13K+），因为部分模型的 per-item detail 文件不完整、\n      格式不一致、或 benchmark 覆盖不全。这是 data engineering 挑战而非方法论限制。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Leaderboard Audit Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"n_models\", \"Flagged (absolute)\", \"Top Anomaly (Δlz*)\", \"Temporal trend β\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"6200\", \"94.2%\", \"185 (3.0%)\", \"+0.031/quarter (p=0.008)\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"5800\", \"91.4%\", \"142 (2.4%)\", \"+0.022/quarter (p=0.035)\"]\n          - [\"ARC-Challenge\", \"5500\", \"89.1%\", \"98 (1.8%)\", \"+0.018/quarter (p=0.091)\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"4200\", \"93.0%\", \"67 (1.6%)\", \"+0.025/quarter (p=0.048)\"]\n      - title: \"Table: Top-10 Cross-Benchmark Anomaly Models (ranked by mean Δlz* z-score)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"MMLU Δlz*-z\", \"HellaSwag Δlz*-z\", \"ARC Δlz*-z\", \"GSM8K Δlz*-z\", \"Mean z\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Gemini-1.5-Pro*\", \"4.82\", \"3.21\", \"2.95\", \"N/A\", \"3.66\"]\n          - [\"[anonymized-finetune-1]\", \"3.95\", \"3.44\", \"2.10\", \"2.87\", \"3.09\"]\n          - [\"[anonymized-finetune-2]\", \"3.72\", \"2.89\", \"3.15\", \"1.45\", \"2.80\"]\n          - [\"... (7 more rows)\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: Δlz*-z distribution per benchmark（histogram，6200 models）。x轴 Δlz*-z，y轴 density。大部分模型集中在 0 附近（normal misfit），长右尾为 anomaly candidates。vertical line 标注 2σ 和 3σ 阈值。\"\n      - \"Figure: Temporal trend line plot（quarterly aggregated flagged rate，4 benchmarks 分色）。所有 benchmarks 呈上升趋势，MMLU 最陡。灰色 band 为 bootstrap 95% CI。\"\n      - \"Figure: Cross-benchmark anomaly heatmap（top 42 models × 4 benchmarks）。颜色编码 Δlz*-z score。展示部分模型在多个 benchmark 上同时 anomalous，但 pattern 稀疏——大多数 anomaly 是单 benchmark 的。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Leaderboard audit 是 IRT-FIT 的 unique selling point（ConStat 需要 re-test，gray-box 需要\n      live model access，只有 IRT-FIT 能用 archival binary data 扫描 6000+ 模型）。但 median 档下\n      结果更适合定位为 anomaly profiling 而非 definitive detection：absolute threshold 产出 ~92%\n      flagging rate（无实用区分力），Δlz*-based reranking 能缩小到 top 2-3% 但无 ground truth 验证。\n      cross-benchmark correlation 弱意味着不能简单说 \"model X is contaminated on all benchmarks\"，\n      只能说 \"model X shows anomalous Δlz* deviation on benchmark Y relative to its model family\"。\n      论文应呈现 Δlz*-ranked 列表 + temporal trends 作为 converging evidence，\n      并明确注明 \"anomaly ≠ confirmed contamination\"。\n\n  - name: \"4PL vs 3PL Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-4pl-ablation\"\n    description: \"比较 4PL 和 3PL(d=1) 参数化下的检测灵敏度差异。\"\n    expected_results:\n      # --- simulation comparison ---\n      power_diff_mmlu_15pct_4pl_vs_3pl: +0.035\n      power_diff_hellaswag_15pct: +0.028\n      power_diff_gsm8k_15pct: +0.012\n      # --- AUROC on controlled data (if available) ---\n      auroc_diff_mmlu_15pct: +0.02\n      auroc_diff_mmlu_50pct: +0.01\n      # --- false alarm rate ---\n      false_alarm_4pl_sim: 0.048\n      false_alarm_3pl_sim: 0.055\n      # --- effect on lz* magnitude ---\n      mean_abs_lz_star_diff_real_data: -1.8\n      correlation_lz_star_4pl_vs_3pl: 0.985\n      # --- key conclusion ---\n      d_parameter_matters: \"marginal\"\n      recommended_parameterization: \"4PL (default)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      4PL 的 d 参数（upper asymptote < 1）建模 \"即使能力极高也可能答错\" 的现象。对 LLM 来说，\n      这对应 benchmark 中存在 ambiguous/mislabeled items 的情况。在 simulation 中，d 参数的影响\n      较小（power 差 ~3.5pp on MMLU），因为 simulation 中污染信号主要体现在 low-difficulty items \n      的 aberrant correct pattern 上，这些 items 的 d 参数接近 1。\n      \n      在 median 档下，4PL 略优于 3PL，但差异 marginal（AUROC 差 ~2pp）。原因：d 参数主要影响\n      high-difficulty items 的 lz* 计算——当 d<1 时，即使高能力者答对 hard items 也不会过度\n      贡献 lz*，减少 false alarm。但 LLM 的 universal misfit 已经使 absolute lz* 失效，\n      Δlz* 作为差分进一步消除了 d 参数的 systematic 影响（两个条件下 d 相同，相减后抵消）。\n      \n      结论：4PL 作为 default 是合理的（略优且无额外成本），但不是论文的关键方法论贡献。\n      这个 ablation 的价值在于 preempt reviewer concern R8，不需要大段讨论。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: 4PL vs 3PL Detection Performance Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"4PL\", \"3PL (d=1)\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Sim. Power MMLU@15%\", \"0.978\", \"0.943\", \"+0.035\"]\n          - [\"Sim. Power HellaSwag@15%\", \"0.753\", \"0.725\", \"+0.028\"]\n          - [\"Sim. False Alarm Rate\", \"0.048\", \"0.055\", \"-0.007\"]\n          - [\"Ctrl. AUROC MMLU@15%\", \"0.78\", \"0.76\", \"+0.02\"]\n          - [\"lz* correlation (real data)\", \"—\", \"—\", \"r=0.985\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: 4PL vs 3PL power curves side by side（3 benchmarks）。差异微小，曲线几乎重叠。inset 放大 5-25% 区间展示 4PL 的微弱优势。\"\n    analysis: >\n      4PL vs 3PL 差异 marginal，足以作为 appendix 中的 ablation table 回应 reviewer，\n      但不值得在 main text 中大篇幅讨论。推荐保留 4PL 作为 default（一致性优势 + 微弱 power 优势），\n      在 Section 5 (Experiments) 用一句话提及，详细结果放 Appendix。\n\n  - name: \"Baseline Comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    description: \"IRT-FIT vs ConStat + Min-K%++ 在控制实验 ground-truth 数据上的对比。\"\n    expected_results:\n      # --- AUROC comparison (MMLU, 15% contamination) ---\n      irt_fit_auroc_mmlu_15pct: 0.78\n      constat_auroc_mmlu_15pct: 0.93\n      min_k_pp_auroc_mmlu_15pct: 0.96\n      # --- AUROC comparison (MMLU, 50% contamination) ---\n      irt_fit_auroc_mmlu_50pct: 0.95\n      constat_auroc_mmlu_50pct: 0.97\n      min_k_pp_auroc_mmlu_50pct: 0.99\n      # --- AUROC comparison (GSM8K, 50% contamination) ---\n      irt_fit_auroc_gsm8k_50pct: 0.74\n      constat_auroc_gsm8k_50pct: 0.88\n      min_k_pp_auroc_gsm8k_50pct: 0.94\n      # --- AUROC gap vs best baseline ---\n      auroc_gap_vs_best_mmlu_15pct: -0.18\n      auroc_gap_vs_best_mmlu_50pct: -0.04\n      auroc_gap_vs_best_avg: -0.16\n      # --- Type-I error ---\n      irt_fit_type1_error: 0.06\n      constat_type1_error: 0.04\n      min_k_pp_type1_error: 0.03\n      # --- information access level ---\n      irt_fit_info_level: \"binary responses only\"\n      constat_info_level: \"binary + re-test (rephrased items)\"\n      min_k_pp_info_level: \"token-level log-probabilities\"\n      # --- scalability ---\n      irt_fit_models_analyzable: \"6200+ (archival)\"\n      constat_models_analyzable: \"~50 (requires live re-evaluation)\"\n      min_k_pp_models_analyzable: \"~100 (requires logit access)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 baseline_auroc_gap_vs_best 在 [-0.25, -0.1]。Min-K%++ 使用 token-level \n      log-probabilities（比 binary responses 信息量大几个数量级），AUROC 在 15% contamination 时\n      达到 0.96——这是 information advantage 的直接体现，不是 IRT-FIT 方法论的缺陷。\n      ConStat 使用 rephrased re-test（中等信息量），AUROC 0.93。IRT-FIT 在 MMLU 15% 时 AUROC 0.78，\n      gap 为 -0.18，在预测范围 [-0.25, -0.1] 的中间。\n      \n      这个 gap 在 50% contamination 时缩小到 -0.04（IRT-FIT 0.95 vs Min-K%++ 0.99），\n      因为高污染产生的 aberrant pattern 足够强，即使 binary-level 信息也能捕获。\n      \n      关键 framing：这不是 \"IRT-FIT 输了\"，而是 \"minimal-information operating point 的代价被量化\"。\n      Table 的第一列应标注 information access level，强调 detection frontier 的 power-information \n      tradeoff。IRT-FIT 的 unique value 在最后一行体现：6200+ archival models vs 50-100 live models。\n      没有其他方法能做 retrospective leaderboard audit。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Detection Frontier — AUROC by Method × Information Level\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Info Level\", \"MMLU@15%\", \"MMLU@50%\", \"HellaSwag@25%\", \"GSM8K@50%\", \"Scalability\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"IRT-FIT (ours)\", \"Binary only\", \"0.78\", \"0.95\", \"0.76\", \"0.74\", \"6200+ archival\"]\n          - [\"ConStat\", \"Binary + re-test\", \"0.93\", \"0.97\", \"0.89\", \"0.88\", \"~50 live\"]\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"Token log-probs\", \"0.96\", \"0.99\", \"0.94\", \"0.94\", \"~100 w/ API\"]\n      - title: \"Table: AUROC Gap (IRT-FIT − Best Baseline) Across Conditions\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"15%\", \"25%\", \"50%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"-0.18\", \"-0.08\", \"-0.04\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"-0.28\", \"-0.18\", \"-0.09\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"-0.39\", \"-0.30\", \"-0.20\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: Detection frontier plot。x轴 information access level（categorical: binary < re-test < log-probs < weights），y轴 AUROC。每个 contamination level 一条线。IRT-FIT 定义 frontier 左端。展示 power-information tradeoff 的系统性关系。\"\n      - \"Figure: Scalability vs Power scatter plot。x轴 max models analyzable (log scale)，y轴 AUROC@15% MMLU。IRT-FIT 在右上方向唯一——power 中等但 scalability 独占优势。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Baseline 对比是 median 档最关键的 framing 挑战。AUROC gap -0.16 (avg) 需要被定位为\n      \"quantifying the cost of minimal information\" 而非 \"our method underperforms\"。\n      论文应构建 detection frontier 图，将所有方法按 information access level 排列，\n      IRT-FIT 定义 frontier 的 binary-only endpoint。配合 scalability 论证（6200+ vs 50-100 models），\n      建立 \"IRT-FIT is the only method that can do retrospective leaderboard audit\" 的 narrative。\n      Gap 数据直接进入 limitation section：\"At 15% contamination on MMLU, IRT-FIT's AUROC (0.78)\n      trails Min-K%++ (0.96) by 18pp — a quantifiable cost of operating at the minimal-information level.\"\n\n  - name: \"Multiscale lzm\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-multiscale-lzm\"\n    description: \"实现 Hong et al. (2021) 的 lzm 统计量——跨 benchmark 聚合的标准化 lz* 总分。\"\n    expected_results:\n      # --- lzm implementation ---\n      lzm_formula: \"sum(lz*_k / sigma_k) / sqrt(K)\"\n      n_benchmarks_aggregated: 4\n      # --- Phase B data ---\n      lzm_range_phase_b: [-45.2, 52.8]\n      lzm_gemini15: 48.3\n      lzm_gemini15_rank: 1\n      # --- flagging with lzm ---\n      lzm_flagged_rate_absolute: \"11/12 (91.7%)\"\n      lzm_improvement_over_per_benchmark: \"marginal\"\n      # --- on controlled data (if exp-ctrl-contam done) ---\n      lzm_auroc_15pct_improvement_vs_single_best: +0.03\n      lzm_auroc_50pct_improvement_vs_single_best: +0.02\n      # --- cross-benchmark aggregation effect ---\n      lzm_reduces_false_positive_rate: false\n      lzm_noise_averaging_benefit: \"weak (K=4 benchmarks insufficient for √K averaging)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 cross-benchmark 信号弱（ctrl_cross_benchmark_detectable_frac 仅 0.35-0.7），\n      lzm 作为跨 benchmark 聚合统计量理论上通过 √K 效应降低噪声。但 K=4（可用 benchmark 数量）\n      太小，√4=2 的 noise reduction 不足以产生实质性改善。\n      \n      更关键的问题：每个 benchmark 上的 lz* 已经是极端值（universal model misfit），聚合后\n      lzm 仍然对所有模型都极端，不增加区分力。absolute lzm threshold 仍然 flag 91.7% 的模型\n      （与 per-benchmark 的 95% 接近）。Δlzm（contaminated - clean）相比 Δlz* 的改善仅 ~3pp AUROC，\n      因为 noise 主要来自 SFT 泛化的 model-specific 效应，而非 benchmark-specific random noise——\n      跨 benchmark 平均不能消除 model-specific noise。\n      \n      结论：lzm 是 methodologically sound 的扩展（值得在 Section 4 提到），但不产生突破性改善。\n      适合作为 \"completeness\" 贡献，不是论文 selling point。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: lzm vs Per-Benchmark lz* Detection Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Best Single lz*\", \"lzm (aggregated)\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Flagged Rate (Phase B)\", \"95.0%\", \"91.7%\", \"-3.3%\"]\n          - [\"Ctrl AUROC@15% (MMLU)\", \"0.78\", \"0.81\", \"+0.03\"]\n          - [\"Ctrl AUROC@50% (MMLU)\", \"0.95\", \"0.97\", \"+0.02\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: lzm vs best per-benchmark lz* scatter plot（Phase B 12 models）。高度线性相关（r>0.95），说明 lzm 没有提供 qualitatively new information。\"\n    analysis: >\n      lzm 的 marginal improvement 符合预期：当 K 小且各 benchmark 的 lz* 高度相关时，\n      aggregation 的降噪效果有限。建议在论文中简要提及（\"We also implemented the multiscale \n      lzm statistic (Hong et al., 2021); aggregation provided marginal improvement \n      (+3pp AUROC) due to the small number of benchmarks (K=4)\"），不值得单独成节。\n\n  - name: \"Post-RL Signal Retention\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-post-rl\"\n    description: \"Qwen3.5-9B 先 SFT 污染再 GRPO 训练，测试 person-fit 在 RL 后是否保持检测力。\"\n    expected_results:\n      # --- setup ---\n      base_model: \"Qwen3.5-9B\"\n      sft_contam_level: \"25%\"\n      sft_benchmark: \"MMLU\"\n      grpo_steps: 5000\n      grpo_reward: \"rule-based (accuracy on held-out math/reasoning tasks)\"\n      # --- post-SFT (before RL) ---\n      post_sft_delta_lz_star: -4.2\n      post_sft_delta_lz_cohen_d: 1.85\n      post_sft_auroc: 0.91\n      post_sft_accuracy_gain: 0.10\n      # --- post-RL ---\n      post_rl_delta_lz_star: -0.8\n      post_rl_delta_lz_cohen_d: 0.28\n      post_rl_auroc: 0.56\n      post_rl_accuracy_retained: 0.06\n      post_rl_accuracy_gain_vs_clean: 0.04\n      # --- signal retention ---\n      signal_retention_frac_delta_lz: 0.19\n      signal_retention_frac_auroc: 0.15\n      signal_statistically_significant: false\n      signal_p_value_post_rl: 0.34\n      # --- mechanism analysis ---\n      accuracy_retention_frac: 0.40\n      pattern_aberrance_retention_frac: 0.12\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档明确预测 post_rl_signal_retention_frac 在 [0.0, 0.3]，即 RL 后信号基本消失。\n      这是因为 GRPO 通过 reward-based optimization 重塑 response pattern：\n      \n      (1) RL 不直接 \"遗忘\" SFT 记忆的 items，但改变了模型的 response 策略——从 \"直接回忆答案\" \n      变为 \"通过推理过程得出答案\"。后者产生的 response pattern 更符合 ability-based prediction\n      （因为 RL reward 奖励 generalizable reasoning），消除了 SFT 产生的 aberrant pattern。\n      \n      (2) RL 的 KL penalty 限制了与 SFT checkpoint 的偏离距离，但 5000 步 GRPO 已足够\n      让 response pattern 从 \"记忆驱动\" 转变为 \"推理驱动\"。accuracy 保留约 40%（模型仍然\n      从 SFT 中受益，但通过不同机制），而 pattern aberrance 仅保留 12%。\n      \n      (3) 这与 Wang et al. (2025) 的 MIA 失效发现一致——RL 改变了 token-level 分布，\n      使得基于 memorization signature 的方法（包括 lz* 依赖的 aberrant response pattern）失效。\n      \n      这是 expected negative result，论文中应诚实呈现为 scope limitation：\n      \"IRT-FIT detects SFT-based contamination but not post-RL contamination.\"\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Post-RL Signal Degradation\"\n        columns: [\"Stage\", \"Accuracy Δ\", \"Δlz*\", \"Cohen's d\", \"AUROC\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Post-SFT (25%)\", \"+0.10\", \"-4.2\", \"1.85\", \"0.91\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"Post-RL (GRPO 5K steps)\", \"+0.04\", \"-0.8\", \"0.28\", \"0.56\", \"0.34\"]\n          - [\"Signal retention\", \"40%\", \"19%\", \"15%\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: Δlz* trajectory across training stages（clean → post-SFT → post-RL 500/1000/2000/5000 steps）。Δlz* 在 SFT 后显著负偏，随 RL 步数增加迅速回归 baseline 附近。exponential decay fit。\"\n      - \"Figure: Accuracy vs pattern aberrance decomposition。两个 bar：accuracy retention 40% vs aberrance retention 12%。说明 RL 保留了部分 performance gain 但消除了 response pattern 的 aberrance。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Post-RL 实验产出 negative result，但这是 informative negative——它精确量化了 IRT-FIT 的 scope \n      boundary。signal_retention_frac ≈ 0.19 落在预测范围 [0.0, 0.3] 内。论文应将此作为 \n      \"honest limitation\" 而非 failure：(1) IRT-FIT targets SFT-based contamination / leaderboard \n      gaming, not post-RL contamination; (2) the mechanism is clear — RL reshapes response patterns \n      from memory-driven to reasoning-driven; (3) this is consistent with Wang et al. (2025) and \n      provides converging evidence from a different angle (person-fit vs MIA)。\n      建议在 limitation section 占 1 段，配 trajectory figure 放 main text。\n\n  - name: \"Extra Benchmarks (BBH + MATH)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-extra-benchmarks\"\n    description: \"BBH (6,511 items) 和 MATH (5,000 items) 填充 1K-10K items 的 power gap。\"\n    expected_results:\n      # --- BBH (n=6511) ---\n      bbh_sim_power_15pct: 0.72\n      bbh_sim_power_25pct: 0.88\n      bbh_sim_power_50pct: 0.94\n      bbh_two_sided_power_15pct: 0.78\n      bbh_predicted_power_from_theory: 0.74\n      bbh_theory_residual: -0.02\n      # --- MATH (n=5000) ---\n      math_sim_power_15pct: 0.61\n      math_sim_power_25pct: 0.79\n      math_sim_power_50pct: 0.91\n      math_two_sided_power_15pct: 0.68\n      math_predicted_power_from_theory: 0.63\n      math_theory_residual: -0.02\n      # --- power theory validation ---\n      updated_R2_with_new_benchmarks: 0.961\n      original_R2: 0.957\n      sqrt_n_relationship_confirmed: true\n      min_items_15pct_80power_updated: 7800\n      # --- 4PL parameter availability ---\n      bbh_4pl_params_available: \"partial (need calibration for ~30% items)\"\n      math_4pl_params_available: \"partial (need calibration for ~50% items)\"\n      gpu_hours_for_calibration: 8\n    result_rationale: >\n      BBH（6511 items）和 MATH（5000 items）填充了 GSM8K（1319）到 HellaSwag（10042）之间的 gap。\n      Power theory 预测 power ∝ √n_items，因此：\n      - BBH: √6511/√14042 ≈ 0.68 × MMLU power → 15% 时 power ≈ 0.68 × 0.978 ≈ 0.67。\n        实际 simulation 可能略高（0.72）因为 BBH 的 item discrimination 参数分布可能不同。\n      - MATH: √5000/√14042 ≈ 0.60 × MMLU power → 15% 时 power ≈ 0.59。实际 0.61。\n      \n      这两个 benchmark 在 15% contamination 时 power 低于 0.8 practical threshold，\n      但在 25% 时 BBH 达到 0.88（可用）、MATH 达到 0.79（borderline）。\n      这精确填充了 power curve 的中间区段，进一步验证 √n 关系（updated R² 几乎不变，\n      说明 power theory 有良好的 out-of-sample 预测力）。\n      \n      实际挑战：PSN-IRT 可能不包含 BBH/MATH 的完整 4PL 参数，需要部分自行校准。\n      这引入额外 GPU 成本（~8 hrs）和潜在的参数质量不确定性。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Power Across n_items Spectrum (15% contamination, two-sided)\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"n_items\", \"Sim. Power\", \"Theory Pred.\", \"Residual\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"1319\", \"0.59\", \"0.56\", \"+0.03\"]\n          - [\"MATH*\", \"5000\", \"0.68\", \"0.63\", \"+0.05\"]\n          - [\"BBH*\", \"6511\", \"0.78\", \"0.74\", \"+0.04\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"10042\", \"0.92\", \"0.89\", \"+0.03\"]\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"14042\", \"0.978\", \"0.97\", \"+0.008\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: Power vs √n_items scatter plot with fitted theoretical curve。新增 BBH 和 MATH 两个点（标记为 ★），落在 theoretical curve 的 ±1 RMSE band 内。验证 power theory 的 out-of-sample 预测力。\"\n    analysis: >\n      BBH 和 MATH 为 power theory 提供两个关键验证点，将 n_items spectrum 从 {1319, 10042, 14042} \n      扩展为 {1319, 5000, 6511, 10042, 14042}。R² 基本不变（0.961 vs 0.957）确认理论的\n      泛化能力。论文中这两个点应直接加入 Figure 3（power vs √n curve），用不同 marker 标注\n      \"validation benchmarks\"。实际价值：将 \"n≥10K 才有实用价值\" 的 claim 精确化为\n      \"n≥8K at 15% contamination, n≥5K at 25% contamination\"，提供更细粒度的 practical guidance。\n\n  - name: \"MMLU Domain-Level Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-domain-analysis\"\n    description: \"按 MMLU subject category 分别计算 person-fit，识别 Gemini-1.5 的污染是全面的还是集中在特定 domain。\"\n    expected_results:\n      # --- domain breakdown ---\n      n_domains: 4\n      domains: [\"STEM\", \"Humanities\", \"Social Sciences\", \"Other\"]\n      n_subcategories: 57\n      items_per_domain_range: [1800, 4500]\n      # --- Gemini-1.5 domain-level lz* ---\n      gemini15_lz_star_stem: 18.2\n      gemini15_lz_star_humanities: 14.8\n      gemini15_lz_star_social_sciences: 12.5\n      gemini15_lz_star_other: 9.3\n      gemini15_accuracy_stem: 1.000\n      gemini15_accuracy_humanities: 1.000\n      gemini15_accuracy_social_sciences: 1.000\n      gemini15_accuracy_other: 1.000\n      gemini15_contamination_pattern: \"uniform across domains (100% accuracy everywhere)\"\n      # --- cross-model domain patterns ---\n      n_models_with_domain_variation: 8\n      domain_variation_coefficient_mean: 0.35\n      most_aberrant_domain_overall: \"STEM\"\n      least_aberrant_domain_overall: \"Other\"\n      # --- subcategory analysis ---\n      n_subcategories_with_extreme_lz_star: 42\n      subcategory_lz_star_range: [-8.5, 22.3]\n      subcategory_level_power_issue: \"n_items per subcategory (50-400) too small for reliable lz*\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档补充 exp-domain-analysis 增加 case study 深度。Gemini-1.5 在 MMLU 上 accuracy=1.000，\n      这意味着所有 domain 都是 100%——domain-level 分析对 Gemini-1.5 不会揭示 differential pattern\n      （无法从 \"全部答对\" 中区分哪些是记忆、哪些是真实能力）。lz* 的 domain-level 差异主要反映\n      各 domain 的 item 难度分布和 n_items：STEM 通常有更多 hard items，100% accuracy 在 STEM 上\n      更 aberrant，因此 lz* 更极端。\n      \n      对 non-perfect-accuracy 模型更有意义：8/12 模型展示 domain-level variation（CV≈0.35），\n      STEM 通常是 most aberrant domain（因为 STEM items 有更高的 discrimination，\n      答错 easy items 或答对 hard items 的信号更强）。但在 median 档下，\n      domain-level n_items（1800-4500）处于 power theory 的边界区——15% contamination 时 \n      domain-level power 仅 0.6-0.75，无法可靠检测。\n      \n      Subcategory-level（57 个 subject，50-400 items each）则完全不可用——n_items 远低于\n      detection threshold，lz* 的采样方差太大。这是 median 档 \"仅 n≥10K 有实用价值\" \n      约束的直接体现。\n      \n      主要贡献：提供 case study narrative depth（\"Gemini-1.5's contamination is uniform across \n      all MMLU domains\"），但不提供额外 detection power。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Gemini-1.5 MMLU Domain-Level Person-Fit\"\n        columns: [\"Domain\", \"n_items\", \"Accuracy\", \"θ_domain\", \"lz*\", \"Bootstrap p\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"STEM\", \"4500\", \"1.000\", \"4.0\", \"18.2\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"Humanities\", \"3800\", \"1.000\", \"4.0\", \"14.8\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"Social Sciences\", \"3200\", \"1.000\", \"4.0\", \"12.5\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"Other\", \"2542\", \"1.000\", \"4.0\", \"9.3\", \"<0.001\"]\n      - title: \"Table: Domain-Level Power Estimates (from theory, 15% contamination)\"\n        columns: [\"Domain\", \"n_items\", \"Estimated Power\", \"Practical?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"STEM\", \"4500\", \"0.64\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Humanities\", \"3800\", \"0.59\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Social Sciences\", \"3200\", \"0.55\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Other\", \"2542\", \"0.49\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: Domain-level lz* profile radar chart（12 models × 4 domains）。Gemini-1.5 的 radar 明显大于其他模型且接近圆形（uniform contamination）。其他模型的 radar 形状不规则，反映 domain-specific ability variation。\"\n      - \"Figure: Subcategory-level lz* heatmap（12 models × 57 subjects）。高度 noisy——大部分 subcategory 的 lz* 置信区间跨越 0，说明 subcategory-level 信号不可靠。仅 STEM 子类的几个大 subcategory 有稳定信号。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Domain-level 分析主要服务于 case study narrative 而非 detection power。Gemini-1.5 的 uniform \n      contamination pattern 是有价值的 descriptive finding（\"contamination is comprehensive, not \n      domain-specific\"），但对其他模型的 domain-level detection 受限于 n_items（1800-4500，\n      低于 practical threshold）。建议在论文中作为 Section 6 的 case study subsection（~0.5 page），\n      呈现 Gemini-1.5 radar chart + 简要讨论 domain-level power limitation。\n      不要在此基础上做 strong claim about domain-specific contamination detection。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14880,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14880},"output_tokens":24,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0b23f9c3-8d77-4ff5-9fa5-c8baa7a4cbd2","uuid":"c4d8d938-9413-4761-aa0b-bd12e4b7302b"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":305735,"duration_api_ms":307100,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 1 收窄 scope：从 \"practical detection framework\" 调整为 \"detection framework effective\n  for large-scale benchmarks (n≥10K items) at moderate-to-high contamination\"。Minimal-information\n  的代价被量化而非回避——power theory（R²=0.96）精确预测 n_items 阈值，这本身是贡献。Claim 2 的 power function\n  分析升级为论文 core contribution——理论刻画 detection boundary 比宣称高 power 更有价值。Claim 3 的 leaderboard\n  audit 定位为 large-scale anomaly profiling 而非 definitive detection，呈现 Δlz*-ranked 模型列表和\n  temporal trends 作为 converging evidence。补充 exp-domain-analysis 增加 case study 深度。需要增加\n  2-3 段 limitation discussion，明确 scope 边界。论文重心从 \"detection tool\" 偏移为 \"detection frontier\n  characterization + scalable anomaly profiling\"。仍可冲 EMNLP main，但 contribution statement\n  更侧重方法论而非工具。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Controlled Contamination Pilot\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\"\n    description: \"Qwen3.5-9B × 3 levels (0%/15%/50%) × MMLU only. 测量 Δlz*(clean→contaminated) 是否显著。\"\n    expected_results:\n      # --- baseline (0% contamination) ---\n      baseline_lz_star_mean: -18.5\n      baseline_lz_star_std: 2.1\n      baseline_accuracy: 0.62\n      baseline_theta: 1.35\n      # --- 15% contamination ---\n      contam_15pct_lz_star_mean: -20.8\n      contam_15pct_delta_lz_star: -2.3\n      contam_15pct_delta_lz_cohen_d: 0.85\n      contam_15pct_accuracy: 0.68\n      contam_15pct_theta: 1.52\n      contam_15pct_p_value_paired_t: 0.018\n      contam_15pct_significant_alpha005: true\n      # --- 50% contamination ---\n      contam_50pct_lz_star_mean: -25.4\n      contam_50pct_delta_lz_star: -6.9\n      contam_50pct_delta_lz_cohen_d: 2.8\n      contam_50pct_accuracy: 0.79\n      contam_50pct_theta: 2.10\n      contam_50pct_p_value_paired_t: 0.0001\n      contam_50pct_significant_alpha005: true\n      # --- go/no-go ---\n      go_signal: true\n      n_seeds: 3\n      seed_variance_15pct_delta_lz: 0.9\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 median 档，SFT 泛化会部分淹没信号但不会完全消除。MMLU 有 14K items，是 n_items 最大的 benchmark，\n      power theory 预测其在 15% 时已超过 80% power（min_items_15pct_80power=7958）。\n      但 SFT 不只记忆 exact items——它从污染数据中学到的 domain knowledge 会泛化到 clean items，\n      使得能力 θ 提升幅度大于纯记忆预期，同时让 response pattern 比 simulation 中更 \"合理\"（因为泛化\n      改善的 items 仍符合 ability-based 预测）。因此 Δlz* 方向正确但 effect size 低于 simulation 预测。\n      15% 时 Cohen's d ≈ 0.85（在 [0.6, 1.5] 范围偏低端），因为约 40-50% 的 accuracy gain 来自泛化而非\n      直接记忆，泛化部分不产生 aberrant pattern。50% 时信号大幅增强（d≈2.8），因为被记忆的 items 占比够大，\n      即使有泛化效应也无法掩盖 aberrant response pattern。baseline lz* 已经很极端（≈-18.5）因为 universal\n      model misfit，但 Δlz* 作为 within-model 差分仍然 interpretable（null 已验证 well-calibrated）。\n      seed 间方差中等（std≈0.9），反映 QLoRA 训练的随机性。总体结论：go signal positive，但需要完整实验\n      验证 GSM8K/HellaSwag 上信号是否也成立。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Pilot Results — Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU\"\n        columns: [\"Contamination %\", \"Accuracy\", \"θ\", \"lz*\", \"Δlz*\", \"Cohen's d\", \"p (paired-t)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0% (baseline)\", \"0.62 ± 0.01\", \"1.35 ± 0.08\", \"-18.5 ± 2.1\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"15%\", \"0.68 ± 0.02\", \"1.52 ± 0.11\", \"-20.8 ± 2.4\", \"-2.3 ± 0.9\", \"0.85\", \"0.018\"]\n          - [\"50%\", \"0.79 ± 0.01\", \"2.10 ± 0.09\", \"-25.4 ± 2.6\", \"-6.9 ± 1.2\", \"2.80\", \"<0.001\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: Δlz* vs contamination level (0%, 15%, 50%) with 3-seed error bars. 单调递增但非线性——15%→50% 的斜率远大于 0%→15%。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Pilot 确认 go signal：MMLU 上 Δlz* 在 15% 时统计显著（p=0.018），50% 时高度显著。\n      但 15% 的 effect size（d=0.85）低于 simulation 预测（simulation power 0.98 意味着 d>>2），\n      gap 来自 SFT 泛化效应。这是 median 档的核心特征——信号可检测但受限。\n      关键 implication：(1) 需要 ≥15% contamination 才有可靠信号，与 min_detectable_contam_mmlu_pct\n      范围 [15, 30] 一致；(2) 完整实验中 GSM8K（n=1319）和 HellaSwag（n=10042）可能更弱，\n      需要更高 contamination level 才能 detect。\n\n  - name: \"Full Controlled Contamination\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-ctrl-contam\"\n    description: \"4 模型 × 6 levels (0/5/10/15/25/50%) × 3 benchmarks (MMLU/GSM8K/HellaSwag). 建立 ground-truth contamination → Δlz* 映射。\"\n    expected_results:\n      # --- MMLU (n=14042) ---\n      mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_5pct: 0.25\n      mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_10pct: 0.52\n      mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_15pct: 0.92\n      mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_25pct: 1.85\n      mmlu_delta_lz_cohen_d_50pct: 3.40\n      mmlu_auroc_5pct: 0.58\n      mmlu_auroc_10pct: 0.65\n      mmlu_auroc_15pct: 0.78\n      mmlu_auroc_25pct: 0.91\n      mmlu_auroc_50pct: 0.95\n      mmlu_detectable_at_alpha005: \"≥15% (3/4 models), ≥10% (1/4 models)\"\n      # --- HellaSwag (n=10042) ---\n      hellaswag_delta_lz_cohen_d_15pct: 0.45\n      hellaswag_delta_lz_cohen_d_25pct: 0.88\n      hellaswag_delta_lz_cohen_d_50pct: 1.95\n      hellaswag_auroc_15pct: 0.62\n      hellaswag_auroc_25pct: 0.76\n      hellaswag_auroc_50pct: 0.88\n      hellaswag_detectable_at_alpha005: \"≥25% (3/4 models), ≥50% (1/4 models)\"\n      # --- GSM8K (n=1319) ---\n      gsm8k_delta_lz_cohen_d_15pct: 0.22\n      gsm8k_delta_lz_cohen_d_25pct: 0.41\n      gsm8k_delta_lz_cohen_d_50pct: 0.88\n      gsm8k_auroc_15pct: 0.55\n      gsm8k_auroc_25pct: 0.62\n      gsm8k_auroc_50pct: 0.74\n      gsm8k_detectable_at_alpha005: \"≥50% (2/4 models only)\"\n      # --- cross-model consistency ---\n      cross_model_rank_correlation_delta_lz: 0.72\n      cross_benchmark_detectable_frac_15pct: 0.33\n      cross_benchmark_detectable_frac_25pct: 0.50\n      cross_benchmark_detectable_frac_50pct: 0.75\n      # --- model-level variability ---\n      model_with_strongest_signal: \"Mistral-7B-v0.3\"\n      model_with_weakest_signal: \"Gemma-4-31B\"\n      inter_model_cohen_d_range_mmlu_15pct: [0.62, 1.35]\n      # --- SFT generalization analysis ---\n      accuracy_gain_from_generalization_frac_15pct: 0.45\n      accuracy_gain_from_generalization_frac_50pct: 0.28\n      n_total_runs: 72\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档的核心预测：检测力严格受 n_items 约束。MMLU（14K items）在 15% 时 AUROC≈0.78，\n      处于 [0.7, 0.9] 范围中间偏上。HellaSwag（10K items）刚好在 min_items_15pct_80power=7958 \n      附近，但 SFT 泛化效应使得实际 power 低于 simulation 预测，15% 时 AUROC 仅 0.62——\n      因为 HellaSwag 的 commonsense reasoning 特别容易从少量 training examples 泛化，\n      泛化学到的能力提升不产生 aberrant pattern。GSM8K（1319 items）n_items 远低于理论阈值，\n      即使 50% contamination 也只有 AUROC 0.74，符合 power theory 的 √n 衰减预测。\n      \n      模型间差异反映不同架构的 SFT 泛化能力：Mistral-7B 较小且 base model 能力较低，\n      SFT 泛化有限，更多 accuracy gain 来自直接记忆→更强的 aberrant pattern→更高 Δlz*。\n      Gemma-4-31B 参数量大，泛化能力强，信号最弱。这个 inter-model 差异本身是有趣发现——\n      说明 detection power 不仅取决于 n_items 和 contamination level，还取决于模型的\n      泛化能力，为 limitation discussion 提供素材。\n      \n      cross_benchmark_detectable_frac 在 15% 时仅 0.33（即 3 个 benchmark 中平均只有 1 个可检测），\n      在 50% 时升至 0.75，与范围 [0.35, 0.7] 在中间档吻合。这支持 scope 收窄：实际可用的\n      detection 仅限于大 benchmark + 中高污染。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: AUROC by Benchmark × Contamination Level (4-model average ± std)\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark (n_items)\", \"5%\", \"10%\", \"15%\", \"25%\", \"50%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU (14042)\", \"0.58±0.04\", \"0.65±0.05\", \"0.78±0.06\", \"0.91±0.03\", \"0.95±0.02\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag (10042)\", \"0.53±0.03\", \"0.57±0.04\", \"0.62±0.07\", \"0.76±0.05\", \"0.88±0.04\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K (1319)\", \"0.51±0.02\", \"0.53±0.03\", \"0.55±0.04\", \"0.62±0.06\", \"0.74±0.05\"]\n      - title: \"Table: Cohen's d of Δlz* by Benchmark × Contamination Level (4-model average)\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"5%\", \"10%\", \"15%\", \"25%\", \"50%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"0.25\", \"0.52\", \"0.92\", \"1.85\", \"3.40\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"0.12\", \"0.28\", \"0.45\", \"0.88\", \"1.95\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"0.08\", \"0.15\", \"0.22\", \"0.41\", \"0.88\"]\n      - title: \"Table: Per-Model Cohen's d at 15% Contamination (MMLU)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Δlz*\", \"Cohen's d\", \"p-value\", \"Accuracy Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3.5-9B\", \"-2.3\", \"0.85\", \"0.018\", \"+0.06\"]\n          - [\"Mistral-7B-v0.3\", \"-3.5\", \"1.35\", \"0.003\", \"+0.09\"]\n          - [\"Llama-3.1-8B\", \"-2.8\", \"1.02\", \"0.009\", \"+0.07\"]\n          - [\"Gemma-4-31B\", \"-1.4\", \"0.62\", \"0.042\", \"+0.04\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: Δlz* Cohen's d heatmap (4 models × 6 levels × 3 benchmarks). 颜色从白到深红。MMLU 列最深，GSM8K 列最浅。清晰展示 n_items 对 detection power 的约束。\"\n      - \"Figure: AUROC curves per benchmark，x轴 contamination %，y轴 AUROC。MMLU 曲线最陡且最早超过 0.8 阈值（~15%），HellaSwag 中等（~25-30%），GSM8K 平坦（50% 时仍未达 0.8）。虚线标注 chance level 和 0.8 practical threshold。\"\n      - \"Figure: Accuracy gain decomposition bar chart（15% level）。每个 bar 分为 'memorization' 和 'generalization' 两部分。Mistral 的 memorization 占比最高（~65%），Gemma 最低（~45%）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      完整实验确认 median 档预测：MMLU 是唯一在 15% contamination 时可靠检测的 benchmark（AUROC 0.78），\n      HellaSwag 在 25% 时才达到实用 power（0.76），GSM8K 即使 50% 也只有 0.74。\n      这与 power theory 的 √n 预测高度一致（R²=0.96）。关键发现：SFT 泛化效应解释了\n      simulation-to-controlled 的 power gap——simulation 假设污染 items 全部产生 aberrant pattern，\n      但 SFT 实际只有 55-72% 的 accuracy gain 来自直接记忆。模型间差异（Gemma d=0.62 vs Mistral d=1.35）\n      为 limitation 提供定量证据。论文中应呈现为：detection power = f(n_items, contam_level, model_generalization_capacity)，\n      其中前两个因素可预测，第三个引入不确定性。\n\n  - name: \"Leaderboard Audit\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-leaderboard-audit\"\n    description: \"Open LLM Leaderboard v1 大规模扫描：对所有可用模型计算 person-fit，绘制 per-benchmark 污染率随时间趋势。\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_models_attempted: 8500\n      n_models_successfully_analyzed: 6200\n      n_models_excluded_missing_data: 2300\n      benchmarks_analyzed: [\"MMLU\", \"HellaSwag\", \"ARC-Challenge\", \"GSM8K\"]\n      # --- absolute lz* flagging (will be nearly universal) ---\n      flagged_rate_absolute_threshold: 0.92\n      flagged_rate_mmlu: 0.94\n      flagged_rate_hellaswag: 0.91\n      flagged_rate_arc_c: 0.89\n      flagged_rate_gsm8k: 0.93\n      # --- Δlz*-based reranking ---\n      delta_lz_star_computed: true\n      delta_lz_reference: \"per-family median lz* as baseline\"\n      n_models_top_anomaly_mmlu: 185\n      n_models_top_anomaly_cross_benchmark: 42\n      top_anomaly_model_examples: [\"Gemini-1.5-Pro\", \"suspected fine-tune variants\"]\n      # --- temporal trends ---\n      temporal_trend_mmlu_flagged_rate_2023h1: 0.88\n      temporal_trend_mmlu_flagged_rate_2023h2: 0.93\n      temporal_trend_mmlu_flagged_rate_2024h1: 0.96\n      contamination_increase_trend_significant: true\n      contamination_trend_p_value: 0.008\n      # --- cross-benchmark anomaly profiles ---\n      n_models_flagged_3plus_benchmarks: 380\n      n_models_flagged_all_4_benchmarks: 95\n      cross_benchmark_anomaly_spearman_rho: 0.18\n      cross_benchmark_anomaly_spearman_p: 0.12\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 leaderboard audit 可执行但 flagging pattern 偏向 universal。这与已有 Phase B \n      数据一致——57/60 cells flagged（95%）。当扩展到 6000+ 模型时，absolute lz* 阈值仍然会 flag \n      绝大多数模型（~92%），因为 universal model misfit 是 LLM response pattern 的固有特征，\n      不是 contamination 特异性的。\n      \n      因此需要 Δlz*-based reranking 而非 absolute threshold。以 per-family median lz* 为 baseline，\n      计算每个模型的 deviation。这能识别 ~185 个 MMLU top anomaly 模型（偏离 family median ≥2 SD），\n      其中约 42 个在 3+ benchmarks 上同时 anomalous。但 cross-benchmark rank correlation 仍然弱\n      （Spearman ρ≈0.18, p=0.12），与 Phase B 发现一致——group-level 相关弱，anomaly 更多是\n      individual-level 现象。\n      \n      时间趋势分析能检测到 flagging rate 随时间增加（2023H1: 88% → 2024H1: 96%），统计显著，\n      但解释模糊——可能是 contamination 增加，也可能是模型越来越强导致 4PL misfit 加剧。\n      这正是 median 档的特征：leaderboard audit 产出 converging evidence 而非 definitive detection。\n      论文定位为 \"large-scale anomaly profiling\" 是正确的。\n      \n      实际可分析模型数（6200）低于原始可用数（13K+），因为部分模型的 per-item detail 文件不完整、\n      格式不一致、或 benchmark 覆盖不全。这是 data engineering 挑战而非方法论限制。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Leaderboard Audit Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"n_models\", \"Flagged (absolute)\", \"Top Anomaly (Δlz*)\", \"Temporal trend β\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"6200\", \"94.2%\", \"185 (3.0%)\", \"+0.031/quarter (p=0.008)\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"5800\", \"91.4%\", \"142 (2.4%)\", \"+0.022/quarter (p=0.035)\"]\n          - [\"ARC-Challenge\", \"5500\", \"89.1%\", \"98 (1.8%)\", \"+0.018/quarter (p=0.091)\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"4200\", \"93.0%\", \"67 (1.6%)\", \"+0.025/quarter (p=0.048)\"]\n      - title: \"Table: Top-10 Cross-Benchmark Anomaly Models (ranked by mean Δlz* z-score)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"MMLU Δlz*-z\", \"HellaSwag Δlz*-z\", \"ARC Δlz*-z\", \"GSM8K Δlz*-z\", \"Mean z\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Gemini-1.5-Pro*\", \"4.82\", \"3.21\", \"2.95\", \"N/A\", \"3.66\"]\n          - [\"[anonymized-finetune-1]\", \"3.95\", \"3.44\", \"2.10\", \"2.87\", \"3.09\"]\n          - [\"[anonymized-finetune-2]\", \"3.72\", \"2.89\", \"3.15\", \"1.45\", \"2.80\"]\n          - [\"... (7 more rows)\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: Δlz*-z distribution per benchmark（histogram，6200 models）。x轴 Δlz*-z，y轴 density。大部分模型集中在 0 附近（normal misfit），长右尾为 anomaly candidates。vertical line 标注 2σ 和 3σ 阈值。\"\n      - \"Figure: Temporal trend line plot（quarterly aggregated flagged rate，4 benchmarks 分色）。所有 benchmarks 呈上升趋势，MMLU 最陡。灰色 band 为 bootstrap 95% CI。\"\n      - \"Figure: Cross-benchmark anomaly heatmap（top 42 models × 4 benchmarks）。颜色编码 Δlz*-z score。展示部分模型在多个 benchmark 上同时 anomalous，但 pattern 稀疏——大多数 anomaly 是单 benchmark 的。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Leaderboard audit 是 IRT-FIT 的 unique selling point（ConStat 需要 re-test，gray-box 需要\n      live model access，只有 IRT-FIT 能用 archival binary data 扫描 6000+ 模型）。但 median 档下\n      结果更适合定位为 anomaly profiling 而非 definitive detection：absolute threshold 产出 ~92%\n      flagging rate（无实用区分力），Δlz*-based reranking 能缩小到 top 2-3% 但无 ground truth 验证。\n      cross-benchmark correlation 弱意味着不能简单说 \"model X is contaminated on all benchmarks\"，\n      只能说 \"model X shows anomalous Δlz* deviation on benchmark Y relative to its model family\"。\n      论文应呈现 Δlz*-ranked 列表 + temporal trends 作为 converging evidence，\n      并明确注明 \"anomaly ≠ confirmed contamination\"。\n\n  - name: \"4PL vs 3PL Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-4pl-ablation\"\n    description: \"比较 4PL 和 3PL(d=1) 参数化下的检测灵敏度差异。\"\n    expected_results:\n      # --- simulation comparison ---\n      power_diff_mmlu_15pct_4pl_vs_3pl: +0.035\n      power_diff_hellaswag_15pct: +0.028\n      power_diff_gsm8k_15pct: +0.012\n      # --- AUROC on controlled data (if available) ---\n      auroc_diff_mmlu_15pct: +0.02\n      auroc_diff_mmlu_50pct: +0.01\n      # --- false alarm rate ---\n      false_alarm_4pl_sim: 0.048\n      false_alarm_3pl_sim: 0.055\n      # --- effect on lz* magnitude ---\n      mean_abs_lz_star_diff_real_data: -1.8\n      correlation_lz_star_4pl_vs_3pl: 0.985\n      # --- key conclusion ---\n      d_parameter_matters: \"marginal\"\n      recommended_parameterization: \"4PL (default)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      4PL 的 d 参数（upper asymptote < 1）建模 \"即使能力极高也可能答错\" 的现象。对 LLM 来说，\n      这对应 benchmark 中存在 ambiguous/mislabeled items 的情况。在 simulation 中，d 参数的影响\n      较小（power 差 ~3.5pp on MMLU），因为 simulation 中污染信号主要体现在 low-difficulty items \n      的 aberrant correct pattern 上，这些 items 的 d 参数接近 1。\n      \n      在 median 档下，4PL 略优于 3PL，但差异 marginal（AUROC 差 ~2pp）。原因：d 参数主要影响\n      high-difficulty items 的 lz* 计算——当 d<1 时，即使高能力者答对 hard items 也不会过度\n      贡献 lz*，减少 false alarm。但 LLM 的 universal misfit 已经使 absolute lz* 失效，\n      Δlz* 作为差分进一步消除了 d 参数的 systematic 影响（两个条件下 d 相同，相减后抵消）。\n      \n      结论：4PL 作为 default 是合理的（略优且无额外成本），但不是论文的关键方法论贡献。\n      这个 ablation 的价值在于 preempt reviewer concern R8，不需要大段讨论。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: 4PL vs 3PL Detection Performance Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"4PL\", \"3PL (d=1)\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Sim. Power MMLU@15%\", \"0.978\", \"0.943\", \"+0.035\"]\n          - [\"Sim. Power HellaSwag@15%\", \"0.753\", \"0.725\", \"+0.028\"]\n          - [\"Sim. False Alarm Rate\", \"0.048\", \"0.055\", \"-0.007\"]\n          - [\"Ctrl. AUROC MMLU@15%\", \"0.78\", \"0.76\", \"+0.02\"]\n          - [\"lz* correlation (real data)\", \"—\", \"—\", \"r=0.985\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: 4PL vs 3PL power curves side by side（3 benchmarks）。差异微小，曲线几乎重叠。inset 放大 5-25% 区间展示 4PL 的微弱优势。\"\n    analysis: >\n      4PL vs 3PL 差异 marginal，足以作为 appendix 中的 ablation table 回应 reviewer，\n      但不值得在 main text 中大篇幅讨论。推荐保留 4PL 作为 default（一致性优势 + 微弱 power 优势），\n      在 Section 5 (Experiments) 用一句话提及，详细结果放 Appendix。\n\n  - name: \"Baseline Comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-baseline-comparison\"\n    description: \"IRT-FIT vs ConStat + Min-K%++ 在控制实验 ground-truth 数据上的对比。\"\n    expected_results:\n      # --- AUROC comparison (MMLU, 15% contamination) ---\n      irt_fit_auroc_mmlu_15pct: 0.78\n      constat_auroc_mmlu_15pct: 0.93\n      min_k_pp_auroc_mmlu_15pct: 0.96\n      # --- AUROC comparison (MMLU, 50% contamination) ---\n      irt_fit_auroc_mmlu_50pct: 0.95\n      constat_auroc_mmlu_50pct: 0.97\n      min_k_pp_auroc_mmlu_50pct: 0.99\n      # --- AUROC comparison (GSM8K, 50% contamination) ---\n      irt_fit_auroc_gsm8k_50pct: 0.74\n      constat_auroc_gsm8k_50pct: 0.88\n      min_k_pp_auroc_gsm8k_50pct: 0.94\n      # --- AUROC gap vs best baseline ---\n      auroc_gap_vs_best_mmlu_15pct: -0.18\n      auroc_gap_vs_best_mmlu_50pct: -0.04\n      auroc_gap_vs_best_avg: -0.16\n      # --- Type-I error ---\n      irt_fit_type1_error: 0.06\n      constat_type1_error: 0.04\n      min_k_pp_type1_error: 0.03\n      # --- information access level ---\n      irt_fit_info_level: \"binary responses only\"\n      constat_info_level: \"binary + re-test (rephrased items)\"\n      min_k_pp_info_level: \"token-level log-probabilities\"\n      # --- scalability ---\n      irt_fit_models_analyzable: \"6200+ (archival)\"\n      constat_models_analyzable: \"~50 (requires live re-evaluation)\"\n      min_k_pp_models_analyzable: \"~100 (requires logit access)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 baseline_auroc_gap_vs_best 在 [-0.25, -0.1]。Min-K%++ 使用 token-level \n      log-probabilities（比 binary responses 信息量大几个数量级），AUROC 在 15% contamination 时\n      达到 0.96——这是 information advantage 的直接体现，不是 IRT-FIT 方法论的缺陷。\n      ConStat 使用 rephrased re-test（中等信息量），AUROC 0.93。IRT-FIT 在 MMLU 15% 时 AUROC 0.78，\n      gap 为 -0.18，在预测范围 [-0.25, -0.1] 的中间。\n      \n      这个 gap 在 50% contamination 时缩小到 -0.04（IRT-FIT 0.95 vs Min-K%++ 0.99），\n      因为高污染产生的 aberrant pattern 足够强，即使 binary-level 信息也能捕获。\n      \n      关键 framing：这不是 \"IRT-FIT 输了\"，而是 \"minimal-information operating point 的代价被量化\"。\n      Table 的第一列应标注 information access level，强调 detection frontier 的 power-information \n      tradeoff。IRT-FIT 的 unique value 在最后一行体现：6200+ archival models vs 50-100 live models。\n      没有其他方法能做 retrospective leaderboard audit。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Detection Frontier — AUROC by Method × Information Level\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Info Level\", \"MMLU@15%\", \"MMLU@50%\", \"HellaSwag@25%\", \"GSM8K@50%\", \"Scalability\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"IRT-FIT (ours)\", \"Binary only\", \"0.78\", \"0.95\", \"0.76\", \"0.74\", \"6200+ archival\"]\n          - [\"ConStat\", \"Binary + re-test\", \"0.93\", \"0.97\", \"0.89\", \"0.88\", \"~50 live\"]\n          - [\"Min-K%++\", \"Token log-probs\", \"0.96\", \"0.99\", \"0.94\", \"0.94\", \"~100 w/ API\"]\n      - title: \"Table: AUROC Gap (IRT-FIT − Best Baseline) Across Conditions\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"15%\", \"25%\", \"50%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"-0.18\", \"-0.08\", \"-0.04\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"-0.28\", \"-0.18\", \"-0.09\"]\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"-0.39\", \"-0.30\", \"-0.20\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: Detection frontier plot。x轴 information access level（categorical: binary < re-test < log-probs < weights），y轴 AUROC。每个 contamination level 一条线。IRT-FIT 定义 frontier 左端。展示 power-information tradeoff 的系统性关系。\"\n      - \"Figure: Scalability vs Power scatter plot。x轴 max models analyzable (log scale)，y轴 AUROC@15% MMLU。IRT-FIT 在右上方向唯一——power 中等但 scalability 独占优势。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Baseline 对比是 median 档最关键的 framing 挑战。AUROC gap -0.16 (avg) 需要被定位为\n      \"quantifying the cost of minimal information\" 而非 \"our method underperforms\"。\n      论文应构建 detection frontier 图，将所有方法按 information access level 排列，\n      IRT-FIT 定义 frontier 的 binary-only endpoint。配合 scalability 论证（6200+ vs 50-100 models），\n      建立 \"IRT-FIT is the only method that can do retrospective leaderboard audit\" 的 narrative。\n      Gap 数据直接进入 limitation section：\"At 15% contamination on MMLU, IRT-FIT's AUROC (0.78)\n      trails Min-K%++ (0.96) by 18pp — a quantifiable cost of operating at the minimal-information level.\"\n\n  - name: \"Multiscale lzm\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-multiscale-lzm\"\n    description: \"实现 Hong et al. (2021) 的 lzm 统计量——跨 benchmark 聚合的标准化 lz* 总分。\"\n    expected_results:\n      # --- lzm implementation ---\n      lzm_formula: \"sum(lz*_k / sigma_k) / sqrt(K)\"\n      n_benchmarks_aggregated: 4\n      # --- Phase B data ---\n      lzm_range_phase_b: [-45.2, 52.8]\n      lzm_gemini15: 48.3\n      lzm_gemini15_rank: 1\n      # --- flagging with lzm ---\n      lzm_flagged_rate_absolute: \"11/12 (91.7%)\"\n      lzm_improvement_over_per_benchmark: \"marginal\"\n      # --- on controlled data (if exp-ctrl-contam done) ---\n      lzm_auroc_15pct_improvement_vs_single_best: +0.03\n      lzm_auroc_50pct_improvement_vs_single_best: +0.02\n      # --- cross-benchmark aggregation effect ---\n      lzm_reduces_false_positive_rate: false\n      lzm_noise_averaging_benefit: \"weak (K=4 benchmarks insufficient for √K averaging)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 cross-benchmark 信号弱（ctrl_cross_benchmark_detectable_frac 仅 0.35-0.7），\n      lzm 作为跨 benchmark 聚合统计量理论上通过 √K 效应降低噪声。但 K=4（可用 benchmark 数量）\n      太小，√4=2 的 noise reduction 不足以产生实质性改善。\n      \n      更关键的问题：每个 benchmark 上的 lz* 已经是极端值（universal model misfit），聚合后\n      lzm 仍然对所有模型都极端，不增加区分力。absolute lzm threshold 仍然 flag 91.7% 的模型\n      （与 per-benchmark 的 95% 接近）。Δlzm（contaminated - clean）相比 Δlz* 的改善仅 ~3pp AUROC，\n      因为 noise 主要来自 SFT 泛化的 model-specific 效应，而非 benchmark-specific random noise——\n      跨 benchmark 平均不能消除 model-specific noise。\n      \n      结论：lzm 是 methodologically sound 的扩展（值得在 Section 4 提到），但不产生突破性改善。\n      适合作为 \"completeness\" 贡献，不是论文 selling point。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: lzm vs Per-Benchmark lz* Detection Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Best Single lz*\", \"lzm (aggregated)\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Flagged Rate (Phase B)\", \"95.0%\", \"91.7%\", \"-3.3%\"]\n          - [\"Ctrl AUROC@15% (MMLU)\", \"0.78\", \"0.81\", \"+0.03\"]\n          - [\"Ctrl AUROC@50% (MMLU)\", \"0.95\", \"0.97\", \"+0.02\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: lzm vs best per-benchmark lz* scatter plot（Phase B 12 models）。高度线性相关（r>0.95），说明 lzm 没有提供 qualitatively new information。\"\n    analysis: >\n      lzm 的 marginal improvement 符合预期：当 K 小且各 benchmark 的 lz* 高度相关时，\n      aggregation 的降噪效果有限。建议在论文中简要提及（\"We also implemented the multiscale \n      lzm statistic (Hong et al., 2021); aggregation provided marginal improvement \n      (+3pp AUROC) due to the small number of benchmarks (K=4)\"），不值得单独成节。\n\n  - name: \"Post-RL Signal Retention\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-post-rl\"\n    description: \"Qwen3.5-9B 先 SFT 污染再 GRPO 训练，测试 person-fit 在 RL 后是否保持检测力。\"\n    expected_results:\n      # --- setup ---\n      base_model: \"Qwen3.5-9B\"\n      sft_contam_level: \"25%\"\n      sft_benchmark: \"MMLU\"\n      grpo_steps: 5000\n      grpo_reward: \"rule-based (accuracy on held-out math/reasoning tasks)\"\n      # --- post-SFT (before RL) ---\n      post_sft_delta_lz_star: -4.2\n      post_sft_delta_lz_cohen_d: 1.85\n      post_sft_auroc: 0.91\n      post_sft_accuracy_gain: 0.10\n      # --- post-RL ---\n      post_rl_delta_lz_star: -0.8\n      post_rl_delta_lz_cohen_d: 0.28\n      post_rl_auroc: 0.56\n      post_rl_accuracy_retained: 0.06\n      post_rl_accuracy_gain_vs_clean: 0.04\n      # --- signal retention ---\n      signal_retention_frac_delta_lz: 0.19\n      signal_retention_frac_auroc: 0.15\n      signal_statistically_significant: false\n      signal_p_value_post_rl: 0.34\n      # --- mechanism analysis ---\n      accuracy_retention_frac: 0.40\n      pattern_aberrance_retention_frac: 0.12\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档明确预测 post_rl_signal_retention_frac 在 [0.0, 0.3]，即 RL 后信号基本消失。\n      这是因为 GRPO 通过 reward-based optimization 重塑 response pattern：\n      \n      (1) RL 不直接 \"遗忘\" SFT 记忆的 items，但改变了模型的 response 策略——从 \"直接回忆答案\" \n      变为 \"通过推理过程得出答案\"。后者产生的 response pattern 更符合 ability-based prediction\n      （因为 RL reward 奖励 generalizable reasoning），消除了 SFT 产生的 aberrant pattern。\n      \n      (2) RL 的 KL penalty 限制了与 SFT checkpoint 的偏离距离，但 5000 步 GRPO 已足够\n      让 response pattern 从 \"记忆驱动\" 转变为 \"推理驱动\"。accuracy 保留约 40%（模型仍然\n      从 SFT 中受益，但通过不同机制），而 pattern aberrance 仅保留 12%。\n      \n      (3) 这与 Wang et al. (2025) 的 MIA 失效发现一致——RL 改变了 token-level 分布，\n      使得基于 memorization signature 的方法（包括 lz* 依赖的 aberrant response pattern）失效。\n      \n      这是 expected negative result，论文中应诚实呈现为 scope limitation：\n      \"IRT-FIT detects SFT-based contamination but not post-RL contamination.\"\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Post-RL Signal Degradation\"\n        columns: [\"Stage\", \"Accuracy Δ\", \"Δlz*\", \"Cohen's d\", \"AUROC\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Post-SFT (25%)\", \"+0.10\", \"-4.2\", \"1.85\", \"0.91\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"Post-RL (GRPO 5K steps)\", \"+0.04\", \"-0.8\", \"0.28\", \"0.56\", \"0.34\"]\n          - [\"Signal retention\", \"40%\", \"19%\", \"15%\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: Δlz* trajectory across training stages（clean → post-SFT → post-RL 500/1000/2000/5000 steps）。Δlz* 在 SFT 后显著负偏，随 RL 步数增加迅速回归 baseline 附近。exponential decay fit。\"\n      - \"Figure: Accuracy vs pattern aberrance decomposition。两个 bar：accuracy retention 40% vs aberrance retention 12%。说明 RL 保留了部分 performance gain 但消除了 response pattern 的 aberrance。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Post-RL 实验产出 negative result，但这是 informative negative——它精确量化了 IRT-FIT 的 scope \n      boundary。signal_retention_frac ≈ 0.19 落在预测范围 [0.0, 0.3] 内。论文应将此作为 \n      \"honest limitation\" 而非 failure：(1) IRT-FIT targets SFT-based contamination / leaderboard \n      gaming, not post-RL contamination; (2) the mechanism is clear — RL reshapes response patterns \n      from memory-driven to reasoning-driven; (3) this is consistent with Wang et al. (2025) and \n      provides converging evidence from a different angle (person-fit vs MIA)。\n      建议在 limitation section 占 1 段，配 trajectory figure 放 main text。\n\n  - name: \"Extra Benchmarks (BBH + MATH)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-extra-benchmarks\"\n    description: \"BBH (6,511 items) 和 MATH (5,000 items) 填充 1K-10K items 的 power gap。\"\n    expected_results:\n      # --- BBH (n=6511) ---\n      bbh_sim_power_15pct: 0.72\n      bbh_sim_power_25pct: 0.88\n      bbh_sim_power_50pct: 0.94\n      bbh_two_sided_power_15pct: 0.78\n      bbh_predicted_power_from_theory: 0.74\n      bbh_theory_residual: -0.02\n      # --- MATH (n=5000) ---\n      math_sim_power_15pct: 0.61\n      math_sim_power_25pct: 0.79\n      math_sim_power_50pct: 0.91\n      math_two_sided_power_15pct: 0.68\n      math_predicted_power_from_theory: 0.63\n      math_theory_residual: -0.02\n      # --- power theory validation ---\n      updated_R2_with_new_benchmarks: 0.961\n      original_R2: 0.957\n      sqrt_n_relationship_confirmed: true\n      min_items_15pct_80power_updated: 7800\n      # --- 4PL parameter availability ---\n      bbh_4pl_params_available: \"partial (need calibration for ~30% items)\"\n      math_4pl_params_available: \"partial (need calibration for ~50% items)\"\n      gpu_hours_for_calibration: 8\n    result_rationale: >\n      BBH（6511 items）和 MATH（5000 items）填充了 GSM8K（1319）到 HellaSwag（10042）之间的 gap。\n      Power theory 预测 power ∝ √n_items，因此：\n      - BBH: √6511/√14042 ≈ 0.68 × MMLU power → 15% 时 power ≈ 0.68 × 0.978 ≈ 0.67。\n        实际 simulation 可能略高（0.72）因为 BBH 的 item discrimination 参数分布可能不同。\n      - MATH: √5000/√14042 ≈ 0.60 × MMLU power → 15% 时 power ≈ 0.59。实际 0.61。\n      \n      这两个 benchmark 在 15% contamination 时 power 低于 0.8 practical threshold，\n      但在 25% 时 BBH 达到 0.88（可用）、MATH 达到 0.79（borderline）。\n      这精确填充了 power curve 的中间区段，进一步验证 √n 关系（updated R² 几乎不变，\n      说明 power theory 有良好的 out-of-sample 预测力）。\n      \n      实际挑战：PSN-IRT 可能不包含 BBH/MATH 的完整 4PL 参数，需要部分自行校准。\n      这引入额外 GPU 成本（~8 hrs）和潜在的参数质量不确定性。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Power Across n_items Spectrum (15% contamination, two-sided)\"\n        columns: [\"Benchmark\", \"n_items\", \"Sim. Power\", \"Theory Pred.\", \"Residual\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GSM8K\", \"1319\", \"0.59\", \"0.56\", \"+0.03\"]\n          - [\"MATH*\", \"5000\", \"0.68\", \"0.63\", \"+0.05\"]\n          - [\"BBH*\", \"6511\", \"0.78\", \"0.74\", \"+0.04\"]\n          - [\"HellaSwag\", \"10042\", \"0.92\", \"0.89\", \"+0.03\"]\n          - [\"MMLU\", \"14042\", \"0.978\", \"0.97\", \"+0.008\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: Power vs √n_items scatter plot with fitted theoretical curve。新增 BBH 和 MATH 两个点（标记为 ★），落在 theoretical curve 的 ±1 RMSE band 内。验证 power theory 的 out-of-sample 预测力。\"\n    analysis: >\n      BBH 和 MATH 为 power theory 提供两个关键验证点，将 n_items spectrum 从 {1319, 10042, 14042} \n      扩展为 {1319, 5000, 6511, 10042, 14042}。R² 基本不变（0.961 vs 0.957）确认理论的\n      泛化能力。论文中这两个点应直接加入 Figure 3（power vs √n curve），用不同 marker 标注\n      \"validation benchmarks\"。实际价值：将 \"n≥10K 才有实用价值\" 的 claim 精确化为\n      \"n≥8K at 15% contamination, n≥5K at 25% contamination\"，提供更细粒度的 practical guidance。\n\n  - name: \"MMLU Domain-Level Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-domain-analysis\"\n    description: \"按 MMLU subject category 分别计算 person-fit，识别 Gemini-1.5 的污染是全面的还是集中在特定 domain。\"\n    expected_results:\n      # --- domain breakdown ---\n      n_domains: 4\n      domains: [\"STEM\", \"Humanities\", \"Social Sciences\", \"Other\"]\n      n_subcategories: 57\n      items_per_domain_range: [1800, 4500]\n      # --- Gemini-1.5 domain-level lz* ---\n      gemini15_lz_star_stem: 18.2\n      gemini15_lz_star_humanities: 14.8\n      gemini15_lz_star_social_sciences: 12.5\n      gemini15_lz_star_other: 9.3\n      gemini15_accuracy_stem: 1.000\n      gemini15_accuracy_humanities: 1.000\n      gemini15_accuracy_social_sciences: 1.000\n      gemini15_accuracy_other: 1.000\n      gemini15_contamination_pattern: \"uniform across domains (100% accuracy everywhere)\"\n      # --- cross-model domain patterns ---\n      n_models_with_domain_variation: 8\n      domain_variation_coefficient_mean: 0.35\n      most_aberrant_domain_overall: \"STEM\"\n      least_aberrant_domain_overall: \"Other\"\n      # --- subcategory analysis ---\n      n_subcategories_with_extreme_lz_star: 42\n      subcategory_lz_star_range: [-8.5, 22.3]\n      subcategory_level_power_issue: \"n_items per subcategory (50-400) too small for reliable lz*\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档补充 exp-domain-analysis 增加 case study 深度。Gemini-1.5 在 MMLU 上 accuracy=1.000，\n      这意味着所有 domain 都是 100%——domain-level 分析对 Gemini-1.5 不会揭示 differential pattern\n      （无法从 \"全部答对\" 中区分哪些是记忆、哪些是真实能力）。lz* 的 domain-level 差异主要反映\n      各 domain 的 item 难度分布和 n_items：STEM 通常有更多 hard items，100% accuracy 在 STEM 上\n      更 aberrant，因此 lz* 更极端。\n      \n      对 non-perfect-accuracy 模型更有意义：8/12 模型展示 domain-level variation（CV≈0.35），\n      STEM 通常是 most aberrant domain（因为 STEM items 有更高的 discrimination，\n      答错 easy items 或答对 hard items 的信号更强）。但在 median 档下，\n      domain-level n_items（1800-4500）处于 power theory 的边界区——15% contamination 时 \n      domain-level power 仅 0.6-0.75，无法可靠检测。\n      \n      Subcategory-level（57 个 subject，50-400 items each）则完全不可用——n_items 远低于\n      detection threshold，lz* 的采样方差太大。这是 median 档 \"仅 n≥10K 有实用价值\" \n      约束的直接体现。\n      \n      主要贡献：提供 case study narrative depth（\"Gemini-1.5's contamination is uniform across \n      all MMLU domains\"），但不提供额外 detection power。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Gemini-1.5 MMLU Domain-Level Person-Fit\"\n        columns: [\"Domain\", \"n_items\", \"Accuracy\", \"θ_domain\", \"lz*\", \"Bootstrap p\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"STEM\", \"4500\", \"1.000\", \"4.0\", \"18.2\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"Humanities\", \"3800\", \"1.000\", \"4.0\", \"14.8\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"Social Sciences\", \"3200\", \"1.000\", \"4.0\", \"12.5\", \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"Other\", \"2542\", \"1.000\", \"4.0\", \"9.3\", \"<0.001\"]\n      - title: \"Table: Domain-Level Power Estimates (from theory, 15% contamination)\"\n        columns: [\"Domain\", \"n_items\", \"Estimated Power\", \"Practical?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"STEM\", \"4500\", \"0.64\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Humanities\", \"3800\", \"0.59\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Social Sciences\", \"3200\", \"0.55\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Other\", \"2542\", \"0.49\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure: Domain-level lz* profile radar chart（12 models × 4 domains）。Gemini-1.5 的 radar 明显大于其他模型且接近圆形（uniform contamination）。其他模型的 radar 形状不规则，反映 domain-specific ability variation。\"\n      - \"Figure: Subcategory-level lz* heatmap（12 models × 57 subjects）。高度 noisy——大部分 subcategory 的 lz* 置信区间跨越 0，说明 subcategory-level 信号不可靠。仅 STEM 子类的几个大 subcategory 有稳定信号。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Domain-level 分析主要服务于 case study narrative 而非 detection power。Gemini-1.5 的 uniform \n      contamination pattern 是有价值的 descriptive finding（\"contamination is comprehensive, not \n      domain-specific\"），但对其他模型的 domain-level detection 受限于 n_items（1800-4500，\n      低于 practical threshold）。建议在论文中作为 Section 6 的 case study subsection（~0.5 page），\n      呈现 Gemini-1.5 radar chart + 简要讨论 domain-level power limitation。\n      不要在此基础上做 strong claim about domain-specific contamination detection。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"0b23f9c3-8d77-4ff5-9fa5-c8baa7a4cbd2","total_cost_usd":0.5178875,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14880,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":16360,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14880,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":16360,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14880,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":14880},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":9842,"outputTokens":23,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.009957,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":16360,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":14880,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.5079305,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"b589855e-e887-427e-a633-76562bfb636f"}
